schway-screen 1
screen help-palette-disabled
title Help disabled actions
description Unavailable keyboard actions stay searchable and the selected one names its reason.
variant dark-120
size 120x30
cursor 11 27 visible
== text
 ⚡ schway  /project


  scripted/scripted-model · scripted API key














       Shift+Enter or Ctrl+J Insert a newline · Continue your draft on another line
       Ctrl+C                Copy selected text · Copy selected conversation text
   › ! F2 or Ctrl+I          Inspect details · No details to show · Esc back
     ! Esc or Ctrl+C         Stop running work · Nothing running · Enter send a task
       Shift+Tab             Change approval mode · Cycle auto, ask and read-only
       Alt+R                 Review changes · Inspect changed files and command results
   ! No details to show · Esc back
